          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { P Q } \\parallel \\mathrm { E F }   \\mathrm { a n d }   \\Delta   \\mathrm { A B C } \\cong \\Delta   \\mathrm { D P Q }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (How ?)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.163,
            0.66,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle \\mathrm{A} = \\angle \\mathrm{D}, \\angle \\mathrm{B} = \\angle \\mathrm{P}   and   \\angle \\mathrm{C} = \\angle \\mathrm{Q}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.188,
            0.796,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\Delta   \\mathrm { A B C } \\sim \\Delta   \\mathrm { D E F }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (Why?)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.214,
            0.782,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We now take some examples to illustrate the use of these criteria."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.246,
            0.745,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 4 : In Fig. 6.29, if PQ ∥ RS, prove that ∆ POQ ∼ ∆ SOR."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.352,
            0.279,
            0.642,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.352,
                0.279,
                0.642,
